OL,3,AUK research funded by China front
OL,4,Acompany being sent to Beijing's spies,
OL,5,AMI5 warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 100 academics linked to
OL,8,FBritish institutions have unwittingly
OL,9,Fassisted China's espionage operations
OL,10,Fagainst the UK via a front company
OL,11,Fworking for its intelligence and
OL,12,Fsecurity services, MI5 has warned.
OL,14,FIn the highly unusual public alert, the
OL,15,FUK's internal security service warned
OL,16,Funiversities and academics that
OL,17,Fcontinuing ties with China General
OL,18,FTechnology Research Institute (CGTRI)
OL,19,Fcould ultimately lead to criminal
OL,20,Fcharges for aiding a foreign state.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
